# HMPPS Prisoner Search API

###
# @name Get prisoner by prisoner number (AKA NOMS number)
@id = A3390EC
# URL encoded comma delimited list of response fields
@responseFields = prisonerNumber%2CreceptionDate%2CimprisonmentStatus
GET {{prisoner_search_base_url}}/prisoner/{{id}}?responseFields={{responseFields}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("Prisoner Search API")}}
Accept: application/json

